301	 * Perform SRv6 Decap if incoming skb is a known SID.
302	 * This must tailcall, as the decap could be for inner ipv6 or ipv4 making
303	 * the remaining path potentially erroneous.
304	 *
305	 * Perform this before the ENABLE_HOST_ROUTING check as the decap is not dependent
306	 * on this feature being enabled or not.
